### Health Check
GET http://localhost:3001/health

### API Info
GET http://localhost:3001/api

### ===== STUDENTS - CALCULATIONS =====

### Get Student Study Time
GET http://localhost:3001/api/students/1/study-time

### Get Student Age
GET http://localhost:3001/api/students/1/age

### Get Birthday Countdown
GET http://localhost:3001/api/students/1/birthday-countdown

### ===== RELATIONSHIPS =====

### Get Student Guardians
GET http://localhost:3001/api/students/1/guardians

### Get Guardian Students
GET http://localhost:3001/api/guardians/1/students

### ===== TEST WITH DIFFERENT IDS =====

### Student 2 - Study Time
GET http://localhost:3001/api/students/2/study-time

### Student 2 - Age
GET http://localhost:3001/api/students/2/age

### Guardian 2 - Students
GET http://localhost:3001/api/guardians/2/students

### ===== ERROR CASES =====

### Invalid Student ID
GET http://localhost:3001/api/students/999999/age

### Invalid Guardian ID
GET http://localhost:3001/api/guardians/999999/students

### Non-numeric ID
GET http://localhost:3001/api/students/abc/age
